                                        <div class="tab-pane fade" id="pills-3" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="Objectives"  ><p>The objectives of the School of Management Studies (SOMS) at IGNOU are characterized by its dedication to provide flexible, accessible, and exceptional management education. These objectives are strategically connected with the university’s primary mission to democratize education through open and distance learning initiatives. Our principal objectives are as follows:</p>
<p>1. Broaden Access to Management Education<br/>
2. Foster continuous growth<br/>
3. Develop Competent Leadership Practitioners<br/>
4. Cultivate an Environment of Innovation and Entrepreneurship<br/>
5. Integrate Theory with Practical Application<br/>
6. Execution of Multimedia and Technology-Enhanced Education<br/>
7. Promote Equity and Social Inclusion<br/>
8. Establish Strategic Alliances with Industry and Institutions</p><br/></div>
