                                        <div class="tab-pane fade" id="pills-5" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="Director&#39;sMessage"  ><p>Greetings,<p/>
<p>Welcome to the School of Management Studies at Indira Gandhi National Open University!<p/>
<p>I am pleased to extend a warm welcome to all our learners, faculty, alumni, and stakeholders. Since its establishment in 1986, the School of Management Studies has consistently led the way in delivering exceptional management education through Open and Distance Learning (ODL) and has now expanded its offerings to include online mode as well. Our prestigious programmes have set a benchmark in India, continually empowering thousands of professionals and entrepreneurs annually.<p/>
<p>At SOMS, we align our initiatives with IGNOU&#39;s commitment to inclusive education and the fundamental principles of lifelong learning. Education is fundamentally a right, not a privilege. It is essential that we focus on accessibility, affordability, ensuring that our initiatives align with the evolving needs of our society. Our commitment lies in designing and executing initiatives that integrate academic excellence with real-world applicability, with the goal of cultivating professionals poised to make significant contributions to the global
economy.<p/>
<p>Our academic portfolio encompasses a diverse range of offerings, including undergraduate and postgraduate programmes in Management and Commerce, alongside diploma and certificate programmes. We conduct a rigorous process of curriculum development in collaboration with industry leaders and academic experts to guarantee its alignment with the latest trends and technologies.<p/>
<p>Our approach is defined by its adaptability. We recognize the varied backgrounds, locations, and challenges encountered by our learners. SOMS offers a dynamic platform tailored to meet the needs of seasoned professionals looking to elevate their skills, homemakers venturing into new career opportunities, and students in remote areas seeking higher education. We are committed to align with your aspirations and objectives.<p/>
<p>As we move forward, our objective is clear: to drive personal and societal transformation through exemplary management education. We encourage you to join us on this journey. Discover our strategic initiatives, connect with our extensive network, and realize your full potential.<p/>
<p>Your decision to affiliate with SOMS, IGNOU is highly appreciated. Let us unite in our mission to create a more just and equitable world, driven by knowledge and strong leadership.</P>
<p>With Best Wishes,<br/>
Prof Neeti Agrawal<br/>
Director, School of Management Studies<br/>
IGNOU<br/><p/>
</div>
