                                        <div class="tab-pane fade" id="pills-8" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="Podcast"  ><b>Freedom 2 Learn</b><br/> 
<br/> 
<p>The Freedom 2 Learn podcast represents a strategic initiative by SOMS designed to deliver valuable insights to learners and stakeholders regarding advancements across diverse fields, with a particular focus on management. Initiated in June 2020, this platform unites professionals across various sectors to engage in discussions on contemporary topics, in line with IGNOU's mission of "Reaching the Unreached" and advancing open educational resources.<br/> 
<br/> 
The podcast seeks to inform students and other interested individuals about the latest advancements in management through episodes. Furthermore, we aim to ensure they have access to digital resources that will keep them informed about the latest themes across several disciplines. The format of IGNOU PODCAST consists of episodes that comprise several series. Each episode centres on a contemporary subject. A series consists of multiple episodes that are highly instructive. A diverse array of themes underpins this. The episodes include expert speakers from industry, academia, and policymaking, identified through a tripod methodology.<br/> 

<br/> 
The podcast can be accessed through the following link:
<a href="https://freedom2learn.ignouonline.ac.in/pages/="_blank"> https://freedom2learn.ignouonline.ac.in/pages/</a></li>
</p></div>
